        {
          "type": "header",
          "bbox": [
            0.754,
            0.048,
            0.86,
            0.066
          ],
          "content": "Algebra Play"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.152,
            0.089,
            0.615,
            0.109
          ],
          "content": "Let us fill the empty boxes with letter-numbers."
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "bbox": [
            0.424,
            0.116,
            0.574,
            0.206
          ],
          "content": "",
          "captions": [],
          "footnotes": [],
          "image_source": "images/page_4_image_2.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.152,
            0.221,
            0.832,
            0.241
          ],
          "content": "From the rules for filling up pyramids, we get the following equations."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.176,
            0.245,
            0.301,
            0.262
          ],
          "content": "$a + b = 60$"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.177,
            0.27,
            0.3,
            0.286
          ],
          "content": "$12 + c = a$"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.177,
            0.293,
            0.288,
            0.31
          ],
          "content": "$c + 8 = b$"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.153,
            0.317,
            0.375,
            0.335
          ],
          "content": "From this, we see that,"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.176,
            0.341,
            0.468,
            0.359
          ],
          "content": "$(12 + c) + (c + 8) = a + b = 60$"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.153,
            0.366,
            0.225,
            0.383
          ],
          "content": "Hence,"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.177,
            0.389,
            0.321,
            0.406
          ],
          "content": "$20 + 2c = 60$"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.177,
            0.413,
            0.364,
            0.431
          ],
          "content": "$2c = 60 - 20 = 40$"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.177,
            0.438,
            0.269,
            0.454
          ],
          "content": "$c = 2 0 .$"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.153,
            0.461,
            0.781,
            0.481
          ],
          "content": "Once we know c, we can find a and b, and complete the pyramid."
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "bbox": [
            0.424,
            0.485,
            0.572,
            0.577
          ],
          "content": "",
          "captions": [],
